TANLY32 7.0 XL7 addin - Tech. Analysis Models
A comprehensive suite of technical analysis
models. The addin includes Regular Moving, 
Exponential and Weighted Moving Averages, 
Percentage Range, Stochastics, Relative
Strength Index, Momentum, Oscillators,Ratios, 
Volatility,Correlation and On Balance Volume.
Spreadsheet template shows how to use addin
together with whatif analysis and charts.
USED BY Banks (needs Excel 7 or later)
